{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有機構推出韓國藝人來港演出投票企劃。首波候選陣容包括朴珍榮、黃旼炫、葉舒華、朴炯植及KISS OF LIFE，投票將於2026年10月18日晚上11時截止。</p><p>企劃共分為三個階段：首階段為網上投票，選出期望來港演出的藝人。第二階段為預付階段，勝出名單公布後，大眾可支付港幣50元預付金。該預付金於正式購票時可作100元使用，並享有優先分配前排座位及參與粉絲福利抽獎（如擊掌會或彩排觀賞等）的資格。若該藝人未能於一年內在港演出，預付金將獲全額退還。最後階段為優先購票，待官方落實並公布演出細節後，預付金持有者可於專屬時段優先購票，並獲系統優先分配該票區的最佳座位。</p><figure><img alt=\"朴炯植。(公關提供)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186506823243796480069148.jpeg/nx86QDotpz3v0A_dfocEZyX7RdNeSmvo40xhtuNMYbY\"/><figcaption>朴炯植。(公關提供)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉舒華。(公關提供)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186506820622225408623047.jpeg/Wjajn3BcUSmxvLYDWfEzfnsOeqmGCaY-m-0Z8ZvtGfE\"/><figcaption>葉舒華。(公關提供)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴珍榮。(公關提供)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186506817988071424205983.jpeg/G6io79BYTGs6wWAYewF07EOBcF52ngNPQkpPaEJKT2g\"/><figcaption>朴珍榮。(公關提供)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴珍榮。(公關提供)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186506815249059840147532.jpeg/tg6L6Dkx7rEZ85fCz3_Y06uAe-ifICFIuHev77h3r-8\"/><figcaption>朴珍榮。(公關提供)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"KISS OF LIFE。(公關提供)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186506825794064384892301.jpeg/1ZSoxiygOGGQsK9EjBIJUnjVJjsSG2TEMtMwRDLTMEQ\"/><figcaption>KISS OF LIFE。(公關提供)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴炯植。(公關提供)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186506823440928768726183.jpeg/LQBbT2rCgmc43_53095zEUmVMxKFj6qI0BJHz9ASR88\"/><figcaption>朴炯植。(公關提供)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃旼炫。(公關提供)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186506820999712768132580.jpeg/hBHpUccxl921pSNw-FlQfYvRQeg_N_GvM466KzOOuis\"/><figcaption>黃旼炫。(公關提供)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉舒華。(公關提供)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186506818487193600059683.jpeg/hAnmuWuvKnkrVsguYX-ZxGJbn9BS8jnGlsKpDZbCqQ0\"/><figcaption>葉舒華。(公關提供)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃旼炫。(公關提供)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186506815798513664154320.jpeg/ENLZ8wplhcT8jR-o0vFeMkWbxUQTdq2W6Ipm_uiKZv4\"/><figcaption>黃旼炫。(公關提供)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T04:59:35.499651+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":388,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T04:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T05:57:51.198827+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T04:57:41.924393+00:00","content_hash":"5af2d6953fb0a8bd72ca108e3568bc9a9de1e3d88d0721edbcd97589eb7a6a72","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}